          <p style={`${S.intro}max-width:96ch;`}>Where specialized understanding meets inclusive care. Breathe has particular expertise and cultural competency in serving the LGBTQIA+ community, while providing inclusive, affirming care for anyone experiencing chemsex or sexualized drug use, regardless of sexual orientation or gender identity. We treat addiction and mental health as equal, connected parts of the same journey, and affirming care here means clinicians who understand minority stress, staff who use your pronouns without being asked twice, and a community where your energy goes into recovery instead of into managing how you're seen.</p>
